    "title": "Tea Tree Trip Soap Bar",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"484\">Energize your skin and awaken your senses with our <em data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"280\">Tea Tree Trips Soap Bar</em>, a handcrafted cold process soap made with pure coconut oil and naturally colored with French Green Clay . Its refreshing green hue and crisp, herbal aroma make it a revitalizing addition to your daily routine.</p>\n<p data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"731\">Infused with tea tree essential oil, this natural soap deeply cleanses while leaving your skin feeling fresh, clarified, and hydrated. The coconut oil base creates a gentle, creamy lather that nourishes while balancing oily or acne-prone skin.</p>\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"1124\">✔ <strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"757\">Natural &amp; Handmade</strong> – Cold process soap made in small batches<br data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"802\">✔ <strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"837\">Moisturizing Coconut Oil Base</strong> – Gentle, nourishing, and hydrating<br data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"876\">✔ <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"906\">Purifying Tea Tree Aroma</strong> – Fresh, herbal scent with antibacterial benefits<br data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"959\">✔ <strong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"996\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Naturally Tinted with French Green Clay</strong>– Clean green tones without synthetic dyes<br data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1042\">✔ <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1072\">Travel-Friendly 60g Size</strong> – Ideal for gifting, skincare kits, and daily use</p>\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1290\"><strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1140\">Skin Type:</strong> Suitable for all skin types, especially oily &amp; acne-prone skin.<br data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1207\"><strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1220\">Best For:</strong> Daily cleansing, refreshing bath rituals, gifting, and travel kits.</p>",
